{
  "id": "E049",
  "title": "I Like to Queue Up",
  "level": "intermediate",
  "date": "2016-09-11",
  "synopsis": "What do you say when approaching a pretty girl in a bar?",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/231/e0cc10926d43b995996f64d7bb4b18e47c498e72.mp3",
  "series": null,
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "我喜欢排队\n\n在酒吧\n男人：你的裙子真漂亮，可以坐你旁边吗？\n女人：好的，你坐吧。\n男人：我请你喝杯酒，怎么样？\n女人：好啊，我要鸡尾酒。\n男人：什么鸡尾酒？\n女人：玛格丽特。\n男人：你的眼睛和头发真美。\n女人：哪里哪里。\n男人：可以给我你的电话号码吗？\n女人：可以，可是我已经有男朋友了。\n男人：没关系，我喜欢排队。",
    "traditional": "我喜歡排隊\n\n在酒吧\n男人：你的裙子真漂亮，可以坐你旁邊嗎？\n女人：好的，你坐吧。\n男人：我請你喝杯酒，怎麼樣？\n女人：好啊，我要雞尾酒。\n男人：什麼雞尾酒？\n女人：瑪格麗特。\n男人：你的眼睛和頭髮真美。\n女人：哪裡哪裡。\n男人：可以給我你的電話號碼嗎？\n女人：可以，可是我已經有男朋友了。\n男人：沒關係，我喜歡排隊。"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "I like to queue up for my turn"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "在酒吧",
      "traditional": "在酒吧",
      "pinyin": "zài jiǔ bā",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "In a bar"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "男人：你的裙子真漂亮，可以坐你旁边吗？",
      "traditional": "男人：你的裙子真漂亮，可以坐你旁邊嗎？",
      "pinyin": "nán rén nǐ de qún zi zhēn piào liang kě yǐ zuò nǐ páng biān ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Man: Your dress is very pretty. May I sit next to you?"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "女人：好的，你坐吧。",
      "traditional": "女人：好的，你坐吧。",
      "pinyin": "nǚ rén hǎo de nǐ zuò ba",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Woman: Sure. Take it."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "男人：我请你喝杯酒，怎么样？",
      "traditional": "男人：我請你喝杯酒，怎麼樣？",
      "pinyin": "nán rén wǒ qǐng nǐ hē bēi jiǔ zěn me yàng",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Man: Can I buy you a drink? How's that?"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "女人：好啊，我要鸡尾酒。",
      "traditional": "女人：好啊，我要雞尾酒。",
      "pinyin": "nǚ rén hǎo a wǒ yào jī wěi jiǔ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Woman: Great. I want a cocktail."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "男人：什么鸡尾酒？",
      "traditional": "男人：什麼雞尾酒？",
      "pinyin": "nán rén shén me jī wěi jiǔ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Man: What cocktail?"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "女人：玛格丽特。",
      "traditional": "女人：瑪格麗特。",
      "pinyin": "nǚ rén mǎ gé lì tè",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Woman: Margarita."
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "男人：你的眼睛和头发真美。",
      "traditional": "男人：你的眼睛和頭髮真美。",
      "pinyin": "nán rén nǐ de yǎn jing hé tóu fa zhēn měi",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Man: Your eyes and hair are really beautiful."
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "simplified": "女人：哪里哪里。",
      "traditional": "女人：哪裡哪裡。",
      "pinyin": "nǚ rén nǎ lǐ nǎ lǐ",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Woman: You are too nice."
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "simplified": "男人：可以给我你的电话号码吗？",
      "traditional": "男人：可以給我你的電話號碼嗎？",
      "pinyin": "nán rén kě yǐ gěi wǒ nǐ de diàn huà hào mǎ ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Man: Could you give me your number?"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "simplified": "女人：可以，可是我已经有男朋友了。",
      "traditional": "女人：可以，可是我已經有男朋友了。",
      "pinyin": "nǚ rén kě yǐ kě shì wǒ yǐ jīng yǒu nán péng you le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Woman: Yes. But I already have a boyfriend."
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "simplified": "男人：没关系，我喜欢排队。",
      "traditional": "男人：沒關係，我喜歡排隊。",
      "pinyin": "nán rén méi guān xi wǒ xǐ huan pái duì",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Man: It doesn’t matter. I like to queue up for my turn."
    }
